cython_debug/

# Gaps in the sections above, listed by `.claude/rules/code-style.md`. Appended
# rather than edited into those sections, so a CodeNow component update to this
# file still merges cleanly.
*.env
*.sqlite3
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/

# Per-person settings: which language the assistant speaks to you, and whether
# you or the assistant commits. Never committed - each person on the project has
# their own, and /start writes it the first time they run it. Shared project
# facts go in PROJECT.md instead.
PROJECT.local.md

# Source app being migrated onto this template (route (c) of /start).
# Reference only, never committed. Delete the whole folder once the rewrite is
# verified.
#
# `_migration/*` and not `_migration/`: git never descends into an excluded
# directory, so the `!` line below would be ignored too and the empty folder
# could not ship with the template.
_migration/*
!_migration/.gitkeep
